# Regression Gate manifest (SSOT)
#
# This file is the single source of truth for what `scripts/regression_gate.sh` runs.
# Keep it small, deterministic, and fast (<5min typical).
#
# Format:
#   - Section headers: [sql] / [python] / [orm]
#   - One path per line (relative to repo root)
#   - Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored
#
# Notes:
#   - SQL entries are passed to `scripts/integration_test.py`
#   - Python entries are standalone multi-session test scripts run with `--dsn`
#   - ORM entries are passed as Vitest filters to `npm test` in `orm-tests/`

